<p>This exact page also emits real JSON-LD structured data — invisible on screen, present in the actual HTML. View Page Source (<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>) and search for <code>application/ld+json</code> to see it directly. Built from the same real front-matter values as the hero above:</p>
